        <li>CP violation is observed, and is insufficient to explain baryon asymmetry.
          <span class="sci">&#9670;</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="frame card">
      <h3>Chosen, and refused</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><em>Chosen:</em> that collapse <em>is</em> the identification of the two faces.
          <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></li>
        <li><em>Chosen:</em> that the CP phase is topological in this specific sense &mdash; owed a
          calculation. <span class="spec">&#9670;</span></li>
        <li><em>Refused:</em> treating &ldquo;a Möbius strip has one side&rdquo; as though it proved
          anything about minds. The topology is used as a precise analogy and labelled as one.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

